1
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:41,680
Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful.

2
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:43,920
One more, one more. Come on.

3
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,000
I just didn't expect

4
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,400
Shen Feng to like this type.

5
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,400
I think she's quite cute.

6
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,760
Can we roast tea over there?

7
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:02,460
Sure. I'll take you to have a look.

8
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,320
First,

9
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:13,960
gently touch the tea leaves.

10
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:16,760
Make sure every leaf gets heated.

11
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,320
Careful, the edges are hot.

12
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,320
How about I test her for you?

13
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,880
Let's see if she gets jealous.

14
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:32,200
Keep your eyes to yourself.

15
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,560
Stop finding fault with me.

16
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,280
Why are you so nervous?

17
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,280
You're so protective of her.

18
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:39,610
You won't even let her
shoot a video for me.

19
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,240
Hurry up.

20
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:44,880
Hurry up.

21
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:48,720
Qingqing!

22
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,200
Are you going to learn or not?

23
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:53,920
I am.

24
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,400
Are you tired?

25
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:18,079
My sleeve accidentally
dragged in the water.

26
00:02:18,079 --> 00:02:19,840
Can you help me roll it up?

27
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,040
Sure.

28
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:24,780
Let me help you.

29
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,480
Done.

30
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,560
My sleeve is wet too.

31
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:41,079
But I can roll it up myself.

32
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,160
Sorry,

33
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:10,160
I thought this plate needed to be washed.

34
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,690
It's okay. I'll clean it up.

35
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,680
It's okay. It's okay, Qingqing.

36
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:14,960
I don't need your help here.

37
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:15,920
Go get some rest.

38
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:18,640
Okay.

39
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,480
Then I'll go wipe the table.

40
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:25,400
Qingqing,

41
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:26,560
the ribs are almost done.

42
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,400
Have a taste.

43
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,520
Here.

44
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,480
Hot, hot, hot!

45
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,930
Spit it out, spit it out!

46
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:47,690
Are you okay?

47
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:49,280
Where did you get burned?

48
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:50,920
I'm fine.

49
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,680
I just need some water.

50
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,120
This time,

51
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,400
thank you all

52
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,280
for your great support of our event.

53
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,810
I'll finish my drink first.

54
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:09,850
Come on, cheers!

55
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:10,640
Cheers!

56
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,839
As the first experience officer
of this event,

57
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,920
I think Yunbianshang is really great.

58
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,160
It deserves to be known by more people.

59
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,080
When I go back,
I'll bring more friends here.

60
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,080
Thank you, A Jia.

61
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,760
Qingqing, we are friends now, right?

62
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,280
Good friends don't need to say thank you.

63
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,480
Then you must visit often in the future.

64
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,280
If your friends come,

65
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:34,140
I'll give them all a 50% discount.

66
00:04:34,159 --> 00:04:36,120
I originally planned
to stay for just one day.

67
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,760
Now I don't want to leave at all.

68
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:39,080
Then don't leave.

69
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:42,080
I-I already booked your flight.

70
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,120
You should go back tomorrow.

71
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,380
Don't delay your work.

72
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:47,200
Are you that eager to see me leave?

73
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:48,800
But sorry,

74
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,880
I changed my itinerary.

75
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:52,520
I'm going to stay here
for a few more days.

76
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,320
Qingqing,

77
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,000
I'll have to trouble you

78
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,440
to take care of me from now on.

79
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,960
You're the one taking care of me.

80
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:04,240
Just remember

81
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,500
to give us more advice for Yunbianshang.

82
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:09,160
Qingqing, this shrimp is dead.

83
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:09,920
Let me peel a fresh one for you.

84
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,080
Nonsense.

85
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,040
I checked every single shrimp
on this plate

86
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:13,920
before cooking.

87
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,720
They were all alive and kicking.

88
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,840
Maybe I was wrong then.

89
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,100
Let me peel one for you.

90
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:29,400
I suddenly feel a bit crowded and cold.

91
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:33,000
Shu Rong, how about I sit with you?

92
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:39,360
Let's just eat.

93
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:42,760
What's going on
between A Jia and Shen Feng?

94
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:45,920
So this is the legendary bickering couple.

95
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,320
Eat some more.

96
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,040
This was supposed to be a relaxing trip.

97
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,760
Why does the itinerary include mountain
climbing and watching the sunrise?

98
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,220
Who on earth planned this?

99
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:27,560
Forget it. I'll stick it out.

100
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,920
Aren't you the tour leader?

101
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,880
Why are you at the very back?

102
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:34,760
I'm at the back

103
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,920
to prevent anyone from falling behind.

104
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:37,800
Let's go. Get in.

105
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,800
I'll drive you up.

106
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,850
We can drive up here?

107
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,640
Then why didn't you say so
last time we climbed the mountain?

108
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:46,040
Was it fun watching me exhaust myself?

109
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,920
My legs hurt for three days.

110
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:49,360
Last time was for a quest.

111
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,620
How could I let you complete it so easily?

112
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,880
I request to lower the quest difficulty,

113
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,810
or I'll delete my account and quit.

114
00:06:58,400 --> 00:06:59,330
Request denied.

115
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,560
Let's go.

116
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,680
Zhe D 27F9A

117
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,880
Why didn't you go up
the mountain with Jia?

118
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:22,010
Why would I go up the mountain with her?

119
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,800
Don't you like her?

120
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,320
Even I can tell.

121
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:29,440
Every move you make is quite thoughtful.

122
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:30,960
But your temper isn't great.

123
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,240
You need to change that.

124
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,680
Playing hard to get is fun,

125
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,360
but sometimes it backfires.

126
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:38,280
I like her?

127
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:42,720
Jia is young, beautiful, and successful.

128
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,800
If you don't change your temper,

129
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,659
how will you win her heart?

130
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,240
Yun Qingqing,

131
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,720
sometimes I really want

132
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,200
to crack your head open like a walnut

133
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,960
to see if your brain is smooth.

134
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,480
I'm just trying to help.

135
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,360
Why are you insulting me?

136
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:02,480
Then, if I liked her,

137
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:04,340
you wouldn't be upset?

138
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,160
I'm not upset.

139
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:10,970
Why would I be upset?

140
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:50,200
Tell me,

141
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,800
am I a failure?

142
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:58,280
I've been the family role model
since I was little.

143
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:02,000
Everyone would praise me.

144
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,160
But look at me now.

145
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:08,080
I've worked so hard for so long,

146
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,480
but I have no car,

147
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,600
no house,

148
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:16,360
and no savings.

149
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:19,040
Why don't you comfort me?

150
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:21,360
Don't you know
I'm feeling terrible right now?

151
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:23,160
Why aren't you saying anything?

152
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:25,920
Say something. Why aren't you talking?

153
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:28,080
I'm really sad, okay?

154
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,840
Are you going to speak or not?

155
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,360
You're drunk.

156
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:36,600
Let's go.

157
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:38,560
Why are you...

158
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,760
Why won't it talk to me?

159
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,680
Be good. Don't move.

160
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,280
With your tolerance,

161
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:49,280
you still claim you never get drunk?

162
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:52,840
Come here.

163
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,960
Stop drinking. You've had too much.

164
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:06,180
It's cold in the mountains at night.
Don't catch a cold.

165
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,360
What's wrong?

166
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,560
You already have A Jia.

167
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,960
You can't treat other girls
like this anymore.

168
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,420
Otherwise, you're a jerk,

169
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:37,040
a player, and a flirt.

170
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:41,370
You care about her a lot.

171
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,440
I don't.

172
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:48,680
Do you want it?

173
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,440
Then answer my question.

174
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,600
You like her.

175
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:12,600
Actually, I'm a little bit upset.

176
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,960
But just a little bit.

177
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,960
Just a tiny bit.

178
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,400
Really.

179
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:23,880
I don't like her.

180
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:26,120
She's the real flirt.

181
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,360
She can fall for twelve guys

182
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,640
in ten minutes.

183
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,440
Don't be fooled.

184
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:35,160
This is a reward for your honesty.

185
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,560
It's mine now.

186
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,280
This puzzle piece is so pretty.

187
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,840
Do you see it?

188
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:54,920
Look at its shape.

189
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,360
I see it. Isn't it pretty?

190
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:04,760
Are you okay?

191
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:16,520
Last time...

192
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,600
was it on purpose?

193
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,040
Which time?

194
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:25,200
When your mouth

195
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:28,960
attacked my mouth.

196
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:32,320
Last time

197
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,170
was really an accident.

198
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:39,080
But this time can be intentional.
